## Modification Notice (GPLv3 §5(a))
**Modern Termux TV** (`Furkan00487/modern-termux-tv`) is an Android TV–focused
modified fork of [termux/termux-app](https://github.com/termux/termux-app) and
`Furkan00487/modern-termux`.

Because the repository history starts on **2026-10-20** without importing the
full upstream git commit history, this `NOTICE` documents the upstream origin
and modifications:

- **Upstream base:** `termux/termux-app` (`v0.118.0`, `versionCode 118`),
  forked and modified starting **2026-10-20**.
- **Summary of modifications (`2026-10-20` – `2026-11-16`):**
  - `2026-10-20` – `2026-11-07`: compileSdk/targetSdk 36 updates, custom theme,
    `RECORD_AUDIO` / `termux-setup-microphone`, custom MOTD, Turkish
    localization, and multi-line paste confirmation (`v0.123.0`).
  - `2026-11-15`: Android TV rework (`v0.124.1`) — removed built-in `x11/`
    module, added `arm64-v8a` / `armeabi-v7a` APK splits, bundled `mksh` as
    default shell, added `< 2 GiB` low-RAM guard and safe TV exit cleanup,
    and migrated the TV interface to Jetpack Compose for TV with D-pad remote
    navigation.

## Corresponding Source for Bundled Packages (GPLv3 §6)
